  "body": "## Changelog\n* ca61c42a173b9e71685191942743010cd09dd156 Bump brace-expansion from 1.1.11 to 1.1.18 in /docs (#1223)\n* 5a10f509f47e446c65588328f387aefdc97805f7 Bump browserslist from 4.23.2 to 4.28.8 in /docs (#1236)\n* 36edfe75519fcd9a740ef1bdfc0bbe3b43d1033e Bump nanoid from 3.3.7 to 3.3.18 in /docs (#1234)\n* 236ca14fca6f4025fbcc9d87e07a835b4bb4f61b INS-2798: Refactor polaris to make it more compatible with other oss projects (#1226)\n* c2ccdb4a5d05b1422a1cbb9c1ca7094b4d1b8de4 INS-2845: Prepare polaris for unifying circleci (#1228)\n* a1328fdce6bcdcb24f83dc90b7bd3fe27c0ea248 INS-2921: Polaris kubernetes test is broken (#1241)\n* 38d07c740a46adce404c94f4acd310fa19b2aa9c Managed by Terraform\n* 65c2a00ba514a3282d7ac9e652caf3f41c919b8d Managed by Terraform\n* fe2597348f8695cf8e344cd95ff84a0ff2f7cbb0 Managed by Terraform\n* cff2caee977eabb88a9963bcf4dcf970708b9bd4 Managed by Terraform\n* cdbb35f4494b1c944cef9dc96d7abbeeb282b9df Update all non-major dependencies (#1231)\n* 4fb77d3b8c8061df978a918a8368b88f64744d76 Update all non-major dependencies (#1232)\n* 46ca881c66e92b7dd01db4c4abd2754080d30c29 Update all non-major dependencies (#1239)\n* a4ca8b6c32cb07196ad3cbf2508dce4304b6a6c3 Update all non-major dependencies to v0.37.0 (#1237)\n* c0e23a233b2087272a7f524f1b922f4e3f2f9689 Update cimg/go Docker tag to v1.26.6 (#1229)\n* 3bfea9bf10269c57d7264b3e3d33c8bc9219957b Update module github.com/sirupsen/logrus to v1.10.0 (#1227)\n* d0f8e12244d76994b6fad62dae0351a1e5e42a0d Update module github.com/sirupsen/logrus to v1.10.2 (#1235)\n* 9fe4a72c779eb6d81e01d9edb46d94fb62226458 Update module github.com/stretchr/testify to v1.12.0 (#1224)\n\nYou can verify the signatures of both the checksums.txt file and the published docker images using [cosign](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign).\n\n```bash\ncosign verify-blob checksums.txt --bundle=checksums.txt.sigstore.json --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n```bash\ncosign verify us-docker.pkg.dev/fairwinds-ops/oss/polaris:v10.2.3 --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n"
